      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17114595_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17114595_0001&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17114595_0001.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17103591_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140407_17103591_0002&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17103591_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;  &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Unknown, To: Jack Krithdey&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;http://107.170.91.122/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/postcard-2014-20140407_17103591_0002.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color: #2b2b2b; line-height: 1.5;&#34;&gt;Front of Postcard: Hello Jackie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. J.D. Krithdey and Vandabirt&lt;br&gt;
MO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now dear Jack,&lt;br&gt;
Do you think I have changed any since you last saw me? Hope you are well and happy and that you will be out to see me this summer. Am still working in the Telephone office and printing for the paper. Write to me as you can.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
